ONTHEWEI: Born for Care;

Born from one belief: gentle protection is love in its purest form. From baby's first touch to a parent's restful night, we use only safe, trusted materials — rigorously tested, never compromised. Because your family deserves the best.

The numbers prove it: 98.7% positive feedback, 3,000+ families, 45% repeat purchase rate. Care that speaks for itself. And partners enjoy a 20% commission — because sharing great care should be just as rewarding.

FITWIND: Fit for You, Wind for Beauty;

FITWIND was born from a simple insight: salon-worthy hair shouldn't require a salon visit. In the time it takes to brew your morning coffee, our 6-in-1 styling tool set turns flat hair into bouncy, glossy curls — at home, on your schedule.

We are committed to a win-win partnership. Through our partner program, we offer a 15% commission on qualifying sales.
